WEBVTT

04:52.834 --> 04:55.084
-Tell me where my wife and daughter are!
-Hey!

04:55.209 --> 04:56.792
Why do you want extra
trouble in this situation?

04:56.875 --> 04:58.167
Just tell him where they are.

04:58.250 --> 05:00.042
They're living safely and
independently. Let them.

05:00.375 --> 05:01.792
You saw what he does to them.
